<title>UK: BADMINTON-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the world badminton championships on Saturday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Mixed doubles final</p>
<p>4-Liu Yong/Ge Fei (China) beat 3-Jens Eriksne/Marlene Thomsen (Denmark) 15-5 16-17 15-4</p>
<p>Men's singles semifinals</p>
<p>15-Peter Rasmussen (Denmark) beat 12-Heryanto Arbi (Indonesia) 9-15 15-9 15-2  </p>
<p>3-Sun Jun (China) beat 2-Poul-Erik Hoyer-Larsen (Denmark) 15-7</p>
<p>14-17 15-9</p>
<p>Women's semifinals</p>
<p>1-Ye Zhaoying (China) beat 6-Wang Chen (China) 11-5 5-11 11-4</p>
<p>2-Gong Zhichao (China) beat 10-Han Jingna (China) 12-11 11-9</p>
<p>Men's double semifinals</p>
<p>2-Yap Kim Hock/Cheah Soon Kit (Malaysia) beat 3-Rexy</p>
<p>Mainaky/Ricky Subagja (Indonesia) 15-9 2-15 15-12</p>
<p>1-Budiarto Sigit/Candra Wijaya (Indonesia) beat 12-Lee</p>
<p>Dong-soo/Yoo Yong-sung (South Korea) 15-11 15-11</p>
<p>Women's doubles semifinals</p>
<p>1-Gu Jun/Ge Fei (China) beat 7-Qian Hong/Liu Lu (China) 15-3 15-3</p>
<p>5-Tang Yongshu/Qin Yiyuan (China) beat 2-Rosiana Zelin/Eliza (one name) (Indonesia) 11-15 15-11 15-9</p>
</text>
